{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime-optimization","title":"运行时优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/runtime/runtime-optimization","wordCount":1390,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"运行时优化\">运行时优化</h1><p>在请出 JIT 这门重炮之前，解释器其实还有一大批&quot;便宜又见效&quot;的优化可做：把常用对象缓存起来不重复造、把字节码序列在加载时重排、把超指令融合成一条、把常量在编译期就算好。这些手段不生成原生码、不引入编译器，却常能拿到可观的提速。这一篇盘点解释器层的优化武器库，并把它和 <a href=\"../jit/jit-principles\">JIT 编译原理</a> 的分界划清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>解释器层优化的共同思路是：用空间换时间、把重复的运行时工作前移到加载期或一次性完成。它们不改变&quot;逐条解释字节码&quot;的基本盘，只是让每条指令更便宜、或让指令更少。和 JIT 不同，这些优化没有&quot;编译开销—回本&quot;的博弈，几乎是净收益，所以即便有 JIT 的运行时也会先把它们都用上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  BC[字节码] --&gt; SQ[超指令融合]&#10;  BC --&gt; QK[内联快速路径]&#10;  BC --&gt; CACHE[对象缓存与驻留]&#10;  SRC[源码/常量] --&gt; CF[常量折叠]&#10;  SQ --&gt; FASTVM[更快的解释器]&#10;  QK --&gt; FASTVM&#10;  CACHE --&gt; FASTVM&#10;  CF --&gt; FASTVM&#10;  FASTVM -.热点仍不够快.-&gt; JIT[交给 JIT]\">flowchart TD\n  BC[字节码] --&gt; SQ[超指令融合]\n  BC --&gt; QK[内联快速路径]\n  BC --&gt; CACHE[对象缓存与驻留]\n  SRC[源码/常量] --&gt; CF[常量折叠]\n  SQ --&gt; FASTVM[更快的解释器]\n  QK --&gt; FASTVM\n  CACHE --&gt; FASTVM\n  CF --&gt; FASTVM\n  FASTVM -.热点仍不够快.-&gt; JIT[交给 JIT]</pre><p>这条&quot;先榨干解释器、热点再上 JIT&quot;的分工，正是 <a href=\"../jit/tiered-deopt\">分层编译与去优化</a> 分层思想在解释器侧的起点：第一层永远是一个尽量快的解释器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存与驻留-不重复造常用对象\">缓存与驻留：不重复造常用对象</h2><p>最朴素也最有效的一招：把高频使用的不可变对象造一次、反复复用。CPython 缓存了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span> 的小整数对象，任何这个范围的整数都指向同一个对象，省去海量分配——这直接减轻了 <a href=\"garbage-collection\">垃圾回收基础</a> 的负担。字符串驻留（interning）把内容相同的字符串归一成同一对象，让字符串相等比较退化成指针比较，从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"a = 100&#10;b = 100&#10;a is b        # True：同一个缓存对象&#10;&#10;x = &quot;hello&quot;&#10;y = &quot;hello&quot;&#10;x is y        # True：编译期驻留的字面量\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># True：同一个缓存对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># True：编译期驻留的字面量</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这类缓存的代价是&quot;判等语义&quot;要小心：<code>is</code>（同一性）和 <code>==</code>（相等性）的区别因缓存而变得微妙，是 Python 新手常踩的坑。但从运行时角度，它是几乎零成本的提速。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超指令与快速路径\">超指令与快速路径</h2><p>解释器开销大头是取指与分派（见 <a href=\"../vm-design/instruction-dispatch\">指令分派技术</a>）。如果某两条字节码总是连着出现，把它们融合成一条&quot;超指令&quot;（superinstruction），就把两次取指分派压成一次。CPython 3.11 起的&quot;自适应解释器&quot;更进一步：运行时观察某条通用指令实际碰到的类型，把它原地改写成专门化的快速变体（specializing adaptive interpreter）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 通用指令在运行时被特化改写&#10;BINARY_OP  +        →  BINARY_OP_ADD_INT     # 观察到两边总是 int&#10;LOAD_ATTR  x        →  LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE    # 观察到对象形状稳定\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 通用指令在运行时被特化改写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BINARY_OP  +        →  BINARY_OP_ADD_INT     # 观察到两边总是 int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LOAD_ATTR  x        →  LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE    # 观察到对象形状稳定</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>BINARY_OP_ADD_INT</code> 跳过了通用加法里的类型分发，直接做整数加并加一个&quot;类型还是不是 int&quot;的廉价守卫；一旦守卫失败就回退到通用指令。这其实是把 <a href=\"../jit/inline-cache-feedback\">内联缓存与类型反馈</a> 的核心思想下沉到了解释器层——只不过仍是改字节码而非生成原生码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编译期与加载期的前移\">编译期与加载期的前移</h2><p>凡是运行前就能算出的，就别留到运行时。常量折叠在编译字节码时把 <code>60 * 60 * 24</code> 直接算成 <code>86400</code>，运行时不再做这两次乘法。常量传播、死代码消除、窥孔优化（peephole）都属此列：在 AST 或字节码上做局部模式匹配，把可静态确定的部分提前算好或删掉。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化</th>\n<th>发生时机</th>\n<th>收益来源</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小整数/字符串缓存</td>\n<td>加载/运行期</td>\n<td>省分配、判等降为指针比较</td>\n<td>判等语义需谨慎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串驻留</td>\n<td>编译/运行期</td>\n<td>相等比较 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)\\to O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>驻留表内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超指令融合</td>\n<td>编译期</td>\n<td>取指分派次数减半</td>\n<td>指令集膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应特化</td>\n<td>运行期</td>\n<td>跳过类型分发 + 守卫</td>\n<td>守卫失败回退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常量折叠/窥孔</td>\n<td>编译期</td>\n<td>消除可静态算出的工作</td>\n<td>编译稍慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些前移优化和 <a href=\"allocation-object-model\">内存分配与对象模型</a> 的逃逸分析、值内联在精神上一致：都是把工作从&quot;每次运行&quot;挪到&quot;一次完成&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时到了-jit-的边界\">何时到了 JIT 的边界</h2><p>解释器层优化有一条天花板：它们再快，每条指令仍要取指、解码、过守卫，分派开销 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 只能压低不能归零（回看 <a href=\"../foundations/interpretation-models\">解释执行模型</a> 的减速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{w+d}{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。当一段代码热到这笔固定税本身成为瓶颈时，唯一的出路是把整段热路径编成连续原生码，让 CPU 直接跑，彻底取消逐条解释。</p>\n<p>这正是 JIT 的领地，也是本 hub 后半的高潮。判定&quot;热到该上 JIT&quot;靠运行时计数（调用次数、循环回边次数），收集&quot;该按什么类型特化&quot;靠类型反馈。CPython 3.14 把基于 copy-and-patch 的 tier 2 JIT 转正为默认路径（见 <a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.13.html\">Python 3.14 JIT 文档</a>），正说明：连最重视&quot;解释器优化&quot;的运行时，最终也要跨过这条边界。下一章会完整展开 JIT 怎么编、怎么靠反馈特化、怎么在赌错时安全回退。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>解释器层优化用空间换时间、把重复工作前移，无&quot;编译—回本&quot;博弈，几乎净收益，JIT 运行时也会先用上。</li>\n<li>缓存与驻留省去重复分配并把判等降为指针比较，代价是 <code>is</code>/<code>==</code> 语义需谨慎。</li>\n<li>超指令融合减半取指分派；CPython 自适应解释器在运行时把通用指令特化为带守卫的快速变体。</li>\n<li>常量折叠、窥孔等把可静态确定的工作前移到编译期，与逃逸分析、值内联同源。</li>\n<li>解释器优化的天花板是分派税无法归零；热到极致只能靠 JIT 把热路径编成连续原生码彻底取消逐条解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一章 <a href=\"../jit/\">即时编译</a> 跨过这条边界，从 JIT 的整体管线讲起。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"运行时优化","id":"运行时优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存与驻留：不重复造常用对象","id":"缓存与驻留-不重复造常用对象"},{"level":2,"text":"超指令与快速路径","id":"超指令与快速路径"},{"level":2,"text":"编译期与加载期的前移","id":"编译期与加载期的前移"},{"level":2,"text":"何时到了 JIT 的边界","id":"何时到了-jit-的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内存分配与对象模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/runtime/allocation-object-model"},"next":{"title":"JIT 编译原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/jit/jit-principles"}}